#: ../../source/docs/interfacing-with-pixhawk-using-the-nsh.rst:5
#: bc0809bbc1fb48a196ad444aceee36a9
msgid "Archived:Interfacing with Pixhawk using the NSH"
msgstr "存档：使用 NSH 与 Pixhawk 通信"

#: ../../source/docs/interfacing-with-pixhawk-using-the-nsh.rst:7
#: d9d873e04c194f7bbcc4f073b3520c70
msgid ""
"This article explains how to communicate with a Pixhawk using the `NuttX "
"Shell (NSH) <http://nuttx.org/Documentation/NuttShell.html>`__ using either "
"a serial or remote connection."
msgstr ""
"本文介绍如何通过串口或远程连接，使用 `NuttX "
"Shell（NSH）<http://nuttx.org/Documentation/NuttShell.html>`__ 与 Pixhawk 进行通信。"

#: ../../source/docs/interfacing-with-pixhawk-using-the-nsh.rst:11
#: 4366f4677092465cab1e328b1eef2039
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "概述"

#: ../../source/docs/interfacing-with-pixhawk-using-the-nsh.rst:13
#: 671583f6bfb7417cb30667779c517368
msgid ""
"The Pixhawk runs the NuttX real-time operating system which includes the "
"NuttX Shell terminal \"NSH\". This allows running some Unix style commands "
"including \"top\" and \"ls\"."
msgstr ""
"Pixhawk 运行 NuttX 实时操作系统，其中包含 NuttX Shell 终端「NSH」。这允许运行一些类 Unix "
"命令，包括「top」和「ls」。"

#: ../../source/docs/interfacing-with-pixhawk-using-the-nsh.rst:17
#: de91c666403d4011851f011d6242257b
msgid ""
"NSH is very useful for diagnosing low level issues. Some of the things you "
"can do with it include:"
msgstr "NSH 对于诊断底层问题非常有用。您可以用它执行的操作包括："

#: ../../source/docs/interfacing-with-pixhawk-using-the-nsh.rst:20
#: aa361daf1c834b789ad43e2212710514
msgid "Display performance counters with the ``perf`` command"
msgstr "使用 ``perf`` 命令显示性能计数器"

#: ../../source/docs/interfacing-with-pixhawk-using-the-nsh.rst:21
#: c128f88246214df687a4480635fec6f8
msgid "Display px4io status information"
msgstr "显示 px4io 状态信息"

#: ../../source/docs/interfacing-with-pixhawk-using-the-nsh.rst:22
#: f7935ac94e3946c5bcf309e66001685d
msgid "Diagnose microSD errors"
msgstr "诊断 microSD 错误"

#: ../../source/docs/interfacing-with-pixhawk-using-the-nsh.rst:23
#: 6e81b42975da4eb99cfbb64da878d26e
msgid "Diagnose sensor failures"
msgstr "诊断传感器故障"

#: ../../source/docs/interfacing-with-pixhawk-using-the-nsh.rst:24
#: 38a9cad09248480abdfc4c23821bacce
msgid "Assist in debugging new drivers"
msgstr "协助调试新驱动程序"

#: ../../source/docs/interfacing-with-pixhawk-using-the-nsh.rst:27
#: 5b82a25efd314b4ba73e1ddd2f2cb3ed
msgid "Running NSH using Debug Cable and Serial5"
msgstr "使用调试线缆和 Serial5 运行 NSH"

#: ../../source/docs/interfacing-with-pixhawk-using-the-nsh.rst:29
#: 304288be98d04058ba14673fa7a9ce38
msgid ""
"To use the NSH while Copter or Plane is running you can connect using Serial"
" 4/5. To do this you will need an `FTDI 3.3V cable "
"<http://store.jdrones.com/cable_ftdi_6pin_5v_p/cblftdi5v6p.htm>`__ and then "
"modify a `DF13 6 Position cable "
"<http://store.jdrones.com/cable_df13_6pin_15cm_p/cbldf13p6c15.htm>`__ so "
"that it can be connected to the FTDI cable."
msgstr ""
"要在 Copter 或 Plane 运行时使用 NSH，可以通过 Serial 4/5 连接。为此，您需要一根 `FTDI 3.3V 线缆 "
"<http://store.jdrones.com/cable_ftdi_6pin_5v_p/cblftdi5v6p.htm>`__，然后改造一根 "
"`DF13 6 针线缆 "
"<http://store.jdrones.com/cable_df13_6pin_15cm_p/cbldf13p6c15.htm>`__，使其能够连接到"
" FTDI 线缆。"

#: ../../source/docs/interfacing-with-pixhawk-using-the-nsh.rst:37
#: e12349c372ce43d5851e4153d680eb35
msgid ""
"You should then be able to plug the FTDI cable into your computer and "
"connect with any Serial program including the Mission Planner's Terminal "
"screen. Ensure to select the FTDI cable's COM port and set the Baud rate to "
"57600. You will need to press return for the \"nsh>\" prompt to appear."
msgstr ""
"之后，您可以将 FTDI 线缆插入计算机，并使用任意串口程序（包括 Mission Planner 的终端界面）进行连接。请确保选择 FTDI 线缆的 "
"COM 端口，并将波特率设置为 57600。需要按回车键才会出现「nsh>」提示符。"

#: ../../source/docs/interfacing-with-pixhawk-using-the-nsh.rst:46
#: 3457eff694c04a6aa5ff16ea48bea38f
msgid "Remote NSH over MAVLink"
msgstr "通过 MAVLink 远程访问 NSH"

#: ../../source/docs/interfacing-with-pixhawk-using-the-nsh.rst:48
#: 0fd454e1def24bc59c12ed5fb9ac4c38
msgid ""
"ArduPilot also includes support to run nsh commands remotely via MAVLink "
"over a USB, telemetry or WiFi link (this is an extension of the "
"SERIAL_CONTROL protocol used for controlling a GPS or radio UART over "
"MAVLink)."
msgstr ""
"ArduPilot 还支持通过 USB、数传或 WiFi 链路上的 MAVLink 远程运行 NSH 命令（这是 SERIAL_CONTROL "
"协议的扩展，该协议用于通过 MAVLink 控制 GPS 或无线电 UART）。"

#: ../../source/docs/interfacing-with-pixhawk-using-the-nsh.rst:55
#: 9bf56ca14ebd4fe295cfac9a40204150
msgid ""
"At time of writing Rover doesn't support NSH over MAVLink (because it "
"doesn't support arming)."
msgstr "截至撰写本文时，Rover 不支持通过 MAVLink 使用 NSH（因为它不支持解锁操作）。"

#: ../../source/docs/interfacing-with-pixhawk-using-the-nsh.rst:60
#: a6d21d15ef9342ddb97cd7a1419a19c1
msgid ""
"This can be used for nsh debugging when you don't have a serial5 cable "
"setup."
msgstr "当您没有 Serial5 线缆时，可以使用此方式进行 NSH 调试。"

#: ../../source/docs/interfacing-with-pixhawk-using-the-nsh.rst:64
#: f48e29271bbb4d8a80292b311a9d791e
msgid "Instructions to use with Mission Planner:"
msgstr "与 Mission Planner 配合使用的说明："

#: ../../source/docs/interfacing-with-pixhawk-using-the-nsh.rst:69
#: 56fc781a913e40d29cc3a3c24a8e92bc
msgid "Connect Pixhawk to PC using a USB cable"
msgstr "使用 USB 线缆将 Pixhawk 连接到 PC"

#: ../../source/docs/interfacing-with-pixhawk-using-the-nsh.rst:70
#: 625dfcdc5533435faa6adb6a4674b97e
msgid ""
"Go to the Flight Data screen, select the correct COM port and baud (probalby"
" 115200) and press the connect button"
msgstr "进入飞行数据界面，选择正确的 COM 端口和波特率（通常为 115200），然后点击连接按钮"

#: ../../source/docs/interfacing-with-pixhawk-using-the-nsh.rst:72
#: fcf601415ef8492085cff9648c89078a
msgid ""
"Go to the Terminal screen, set the left-most drop down to \"NSH\" and push "
"Connect."
msgstr "进入终端界面，将最左侧的下拉菜单设置为「NSH」，然后点击连接。"

#: ../../source/docs/interfacing-with-pixhawk-using-the-nsh.rst:76
#: 08dc268b891b4e039e04b73ae9cf6e83
msgid "Setup instructions to access using MAVProxy:"
msgstr "使用 MAVProxy 访问的设置说明："

#: ../../source/docs/interfacing-with-pixhawk-using-the-nsh.rst:78
#: 1bd653bbdc164366b2509724bb763589
msgid "Load latest master onto a Pixhawk"
msgstr "将最新的 master 版本加载到 Pixhawk 上"

#: ../../source/docs/interfacing-with-pixhawk-using-the-nsh.rst:79
#: 83463265a0dd4938979e542749a2f1c9
msgid "Grab the latest *MAVProxy*"
msgstr "获取最新版本的 *MAVProxy*"

#: ../../source/docs/interfacing-with-pixhawk-using-the-nsh.rst:81
#: 33723511c20549759d5cca60c392edf2
msgid "If on Linux use:"
msgstr "如果在 Linux 上，请使用："

#: ../../source/docs/interfacing-with-pixhawk-using-the-nsh.rst:87
#: f2ef2b8a3be1456cb4c8e105cbab5650
msgid ""
"If on Windows `grab it here "
"<https://firmware.ardupilot.org/Tools/MAVProxy/>`__."
msgstr ""
"如果在 Windows 上，请 `从此处获取 <https://firmware.ardupilot.org/Tools/MAVProxy/>`__。"

#: ../../source/docs/interfacing-with-pixhawk-using-the-nsh.rst:93
#: 693e2ff6dabf48af823cb45e8a54f106
msgid "If you are on Windows you will need to delete any old"
msgstr "如果您在 Windows 上，需要先删除所有旧的"

#: ../../source/docs/interfacing-with-pixhawk-using-the-nsh.rst:92
#: 9d424d06f1c8471fa82f60723987d6a4
msgid ""
"version of MAVProxy in **c:\\\\Program Files (x86)\\\\MAVProxy** first, as "
"the installer does not properly cleanup old versions."
msgstr "**c:\\\\Program Files (x86)\\\\MAVProxy** 中的 MAVProxy 版本，因为安装程序不会正确清理旧版本。"

#: ../../source/docs/interfacing-with-pixhawk-using-the-nsh.rst:96
#: 0776c06018c84d37871838166fa050e9
msgid "Start *MAVProxy* as usual"
msgstr "像往常一样启动 *MAVProxy*"

#: ../../source/docs/interfacing-with-pixhawk-using-the-nsh.rst:97
#: 6136b4a89496499d8ba8e7b9c2d7ec65
msgid "Load the nsh module in *MAVProxy* with"
msgstr "在 *MAVProxy* 中使用以下命令加载 NSH 模块"

#: ../../source/docs/interfacing-with-pixhawk-using-the-nsh.rst:103
#: 4b79a2d3c185463bb2fc36cb9fc345f2
msgid "start the nsh shell with"
msgstr "使用以下命令启动 NSH shell"

#: ../../source/docs/interfacing-with-pixhawk-using-the-nsh.rst:109
#: 4ba2d6fc9ca5428b90710ade0d7a934c
msgid ""
"Now run nsh commands as usual. Note that MAVLink is still running, so the "
"map, *MAPVproxy console*, graphs etc all keep updating while in the nsh "
"shell."
msgstr ""
"现在可以像往常一样运行 NSH 命令。请注意，MAVLink 仍在运行，因此在 NSH shell 中时，地图、*MAVProxy "
"控制台*、图表等仍会持续更新。"

#: ../../source/docs/interfacing-with-pixhawk-using-the-nsh.rst:115
#: 9868063c4c114f7c86b806d39665dad2
msgid ""
"A blank response to an NSH command may indicate low RAM memory on the "
"autopilot board. Free up memory if possible. For example, on master you can "
"save about 20Kb by disabling terrain following (set ``TERRAIN_ENABLE=0``)."
msgstr ""
"NSH 命令无响应（空白回应）可能表明自动驾驶仪主板的 RAM 内存不足。请尽可能释放内存。例如，在 master 分支上，可以通过禁用地形跟随（设置 "
"``TERRAIN_ENABLE=0``）节省约 20KB 内存。"

#: ../../source/docs/interfacing-with-pixhawk-using-the-nsh.rst:120
#: ba0e102bfcd4489ab43b7890a3610a62
msgid ""
"To drop back to the normal *MAVProxy* prompt type a single \".\" on a line "
"by itself"
msgstr "要返回正常的 *MAVProxy* 提示符，请在单独一行输入一个「.」"

#: ../../source/docs/interfacing-with-pixhawk-using-the-nsh.rst:123
#: c76ba0d2c0f14990843d774ff848a545
msgid ""
"You can only start a shell when the system is disarmed. Once the shell is "
"started you can arm if you like."
msgstr "只有在系统未解锁时才能启动 shell。一旦 shell 启动，您可以根据需要进行解锁。"

#: ../../source/docs/interfacing-with-pixhawk-using-the-nsh.rst:128
#: 46069bd96fa841b9b4e2b2ca47322c01
msgid ""
"In theory you could fly while doing nsh commands, but we don't recommend it."
msgstr "理论上您可以在执行 NSH 命令的同时飞行，但我们不建议这样做。"

#: ../../source/docs/interfacing-with-pixhawk-using-the-nsh.rst:131
#: 8f7e08579a1144349d685d07ba27785b
msgid ""
"This also works over a 3DR Radio link, although it is of course slower in "
"output than when on a USB connection."
msgstr "这也适用于 3DR 无线电链路，但输出速度自然比 USB 连接时慢。"
